---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const stripeLink = "https://buy.stripe.com/9B600ke6FdEN21H1Cg3Nm05";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Complete Deck Planning Kit — $49 | DMV Deck Designs"
  description="A professional homeowner workbook for planning a new deck, replacement, or expansion. Organize measurements, layout decisions, materials, budget, permit preparation, and contractor conversations before you spend thousands."
>
  <main class="kit-page">
    <section class="kit-hero">
      <div class="kit-container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="kit-badge">THE $49 DECK PLANNING SYSTEM</div>
          <h1>Know What You’re Building <span>Before You Spend.</span></h1>
          <p class="kit-lead">
            A professional, homeowner-friendly planning workbook that turns a vague deck idea
            into an organized project plan—before you call contractors, buy materials, or pay
            for professional drawings.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-proof">
            <span>✓ Digital PDF</span>
            <span>✓ One-time $49 purchase</span>
            <span>✓ Instant secure delivery after payment</span>
          </div>

          <a class="kit-button kit-button-large" href={stripeLink}>Get the Complete Kit — $49</a>
          <p class="secure-note">Secure checkout through Stripe • No subscription</p>
        </div>

        <div class="workbook-card" aria-label="Complete Deck Planning Kit preview">
          <div class="workbook-top">DMV DECK DESIGNS</div>
          <div class="workbook-title">COMPLETE<br /><strong>DECK PLANNING</strong><br />KIT</div>
          <div class="workbook-rule"></div>
          <div class="workbook-items">
            <span>MEASURE</span>
            <span>PLAN</span>
            <span>BUDGET</span>
            <span>PREPARE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="workbook-price">$49</div>
          <div class="workbook-footer">PROFESSIONAL HOMEOWNER WORKBOOK</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-section value-section">
      <div class="kit-container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="section-kicker">WHY IT EXISTS</div>
          <h2>Most Deck Problems Start <span>Before Construction.</span></h2>
          <p>
            The expensive mistakes are often planning mistakes: incomplete measurements,
            unclear priorities, missing site information, unrealistic budgets, and poorly
            defined expectations. This kit helps you get organized first.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-grid">
          <article><b>01</b><h3>Stop Guessing</h3><p>Capture the dimensions, access points, existing conditions, and project goals you need to make better decisions.</p></article>
          <article><b>02</b><h3>Get Contractor-Ready</h3><p>Walk into contractor conversations with organized information and better questions instead of starting from scratch.</p></article>
          <article><b>03</b><h3>Control the Scope</h3><p>Decide what matters to you before estimates arrive, so changes and surprises are easier to identify.</p></article>
          <article><b>04</b><h3>Prepare Smarter</h3><p>Use a structured checklist for permits, documents, materials, scheduling, and the next step in your project.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-section included-section">
      <div class="kit-container">
        <div class="section-heading centered">
          <div class="section-kicker">INSIDE THE KIT</div>
          <h2>More Than a Checklist.</h2>
          <p>A guided planning system you can actually use while standing in your yard, talking with a contractor, or preparing for professional design.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="included-grid">
          <article class="included-card featured"><div class="number">01</div><h3>Project Planning Workbook</h3><p>Define the project, goals, priorities, constraints, and decisions that need to be made.</p><ul><li>Project goals</li><li>Deck type & intended use</li><li>Features & priorities</li></ul></article>
          <article class="included-card"><div class="number">02</div><h3>Site & Measurement Guide</h3><p>Organize the measurements and existing-condition information needed to move the project forward.</p><ul><li>Property measurements</li><li>House & access conditions</li><li>Photo/document checklist</li></ul></article>
          <article class="included-card"><div class="number">03</div><h3>Layout & Design Worksheets</h3><p>Work through size, placement, circulation, stairs, features, and material preferences.</p><ul><li>Layout planning</li><li>Feature planning</li><li>Material selection</li></ul></article>
          <article class="included-card"><div class="number">04</div><h3>Budget Planning Worksheet</h3><p>Build a realistic project-planning framework before you compare estimates.</p><ul><li>Major cost categories</li><li>Priority decisions</li><li>Estimate comparison notes</li></ul></article>
          <article class="included-card"><div class="number">05</div><h3>Permit Preparation Checklist</h3><p>Organize common project information and documents so you know what to investigate for your jurisdiction.</p><ul><li>Project information</li><li>Documents to gather</li><li>Questions for your jurisdiction</li></ul></article>
          <article class="included-card"><div class="number">06</div><h3>Contractor & Project Checklist</h3><p>Prepare better conversations and keep the project organized from planning through the next step.</p><ul><li>Contractor questions</li><li>Project timeline</li><li>Final planning review</li></ul></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-section outcome-section">
      <div class="kit-container outcome-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="section-kicker">WHEN YOU FINISH</div>
          <h2>You’ll Have a <span>Clearer Project.</span></h2>
          <p class="outcome-lead">Instead of having a collection of ideas, photos, and contractor questions, you’ll have one organized planning reference for your deck project.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="outcome-list">
          <div><span>✓</span><p>Your project goals and priorities are documented.</p></div>
          <div><span>✓</span><p>Your site information and measurements are organized.</p></div>
          <div><span>✓</span><p>Your preferred layout, features, and materials are easier to discuss.</p></div>
          <div><span>✓</span><p>Your budget categories and estimate questions are in one place.</p></div>
          <div><span>✓</span><p>You have a practical checklist for the next stage of the project.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-section audience-section">
      <div class="kit-container audience-grid">
        <div class="audience-card">
          <div class="section-kicker">MADE FOR</div>
          <h2>Homeowners Who Want to <span>Be Prepared.</span></h2>
          <div class="audience-list">
            <p>✓ Planning a new deck</p>
            <p>✓ Replacing an existing deck</p>
            <p>✓ Considering a deck expansion</p>
            <p>✓ Comparing contractor estimates</p>
            <p>✓ Preparing for professional deck design</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="not-card">
          <div class="section-kicker">IMPORTANT</div>
          <h3>This is a planning tool—not a set of construction drawings.</h3>
          <p>The kit helps you organize your project. It does not replace site-specific engineering, professional design drawings, permits, or approval requirements.</p>
          <p>When you are ready for professional permit-ready deck plans, DMV Deck Designs can take your organized project information to the next stage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-section offer-section">
      <div class="kit-container">
        <div class="offer-card">
          <div class="offer-copy">
            <div class="section-kicker">GET STARTED TODAY</div>
            <h2>The Complete Deck Planning Kit</h2>
            <p>Everything you need to organize your deck project before making the bigger commitment.</p>
            <div class="offer-points"><span>✓ One-time purchase</span><span>✓ Digital PDF</span><span>✓ Secure delivery</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="offer-price">
            <div class="price">$49</div>
            <div>One-time payment</div>
            <a class="kit-button" href={stripeLink}>Get the Kit</a>
            <small>Secure checkout through Stripe</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="upgrade-section">
      <div class="kit-container upgrade-inner">
        <div>
          <div class="section-kicker light">NEXT STEP</div>
          <h2>Have the plan. <span>Now make it professional.</span></h2>
          <p>When you are ready for custom permit-ready plans and professional CAD drawings, explore DMV Deck Designs’ professional design packages.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="kit-button light-button" href="/purchase/">View Professional Design Packages</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .kit-page{--navy:#17365d;--blue:#1b365d;--red:#b22234;--light:#f4f7fa;--ink:#17212b;--muted:#596572;--line:#dfe5eb;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
    .kit-container{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto}
    .kit-hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4f7fa 0%,#fff 62%,#eef3f8 100%);padding:76px 0 82px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;align-items:center;gap:65px}
    .kit-badge,.section-kicker{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--red)}
    .kit-badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .hero-copy h1{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);line-height:1.02;margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-.02em}
    .hero-copy h1 span,.section-heading h2 span,.outcome-grid h2 span,.audience-card h2 span,.upgrade-inner h2 span{color:var(--red)}
    .kit-lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);max-width:720px;margin:0 0 24px}
    .hero-proof{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;margin:0 0 28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
    .kit-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--red);color:#fff!important;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 23px;border-radius:5px;font-weight:800;box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(178,34,52,.18);transition:transform .15s ease,opacity .15s ease}
    .kit-button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);opacity:.94}.kit-button-large{font-size:18px;padding:17px 28px}.secure-note{font-size:12px;color:#78838d;margin:10px 0 0}
    .workbook-card{max-width:390px;width:100%;justify-self:center;aspect-ratio:4/5.2;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:30px;box-shadow:18px 20px 0 #dce4ec,0 20px 50px rgba(23,54,93,.18);position:relative;transform:rotate(2deg)}
    .workbook-top{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding-bottom:14px}.workbook-title{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:44px;line-height:1.04;margin-top:55px;letter-spacing:.02em}.workbook-title strong{color:#fff}.workbook-rule{width:70px;border-top:5px solid #fff;margin:25px 0}.workbook-items{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.workbook-price{position:absolute;right:28px;bottom:48px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:58px}.workbook-footer{position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:30px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;opacity:.8}
    .kit-section{padding:82px 0}.value-section{background:#fff}.section-heading{max-width:820px;margin-bottom:42px}.section-heading.centered{text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.section-heading h2,.outcome-grid h2,.audience-card h2,.upgrade-inner h2{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.08;color:var(--navy);margin:10px 0 16px}.section-heading p,.outcome-lead{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}
    .problem-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.problem-grid article{border-top:4px solid var(--navy);padding:23px 20px;background:var(--light)}.problem-grid b{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--red);font-size:22px}.problem-grid h3{color:var(--navy);font-size:21px;margin:12px 0 8px}.problem-grid p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin:0}
    .included-section{background:var(--light);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.included-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.included-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 26px;min-height:270px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(23,54,93,.04)}.included-card.featured{border-top:5px solid var(--red)}.number{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--red);font-size:25px}.included-card h3{color:var(--navy);font-size:22px;margin:8px 0}.included-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.included-card ul{padding-left:19px;color:#45525e;line-height:1.9}
    .outcome-section{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.outcome-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:75px;align-items:center}.outcome-grid h2{color:#fff}.outcome-lead{color:#dbe4ec}.outcome-list{display:grid;gap:13px}.outcome-list div{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:flex-start;padding:14px 16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}.outcome-list span{color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:20px}.outcome-list p{margin:0;line-height:1.5;color:#f1f5f8}
    .audience-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.audience-card,.not-card{padding:40px;background:var(--light);border:1px solid var(--line)}.audience-list{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:25px}.audience-list p{margin:0;padding:11px 14px;background:#fff;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700}.not-card{background:#fff;border-left:5px solid var(--red)}.not-card h3{font-size:25px;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.25;margin:12px 0}.not-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
    .offer-section{padding-top:20px}.offer-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 310px;gap:40px;align-items:center;background:#f7f9fb;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:48px}.offer-copy h2{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--navy);font-size:42px;margin:10px 0}.offer-copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}.offer-points{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 22px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.offer-price{text-align:center;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:40px}.offer-price .price{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:72px;line-height:1;color:var(--navy)}.offer-price>div:nth-child(2){color:var(--muted);margin:5px 0 20px}.offer-price small{display:block;color:#78838d;margin-top:9px;font-size:11px}
    .upgrade-section{background:var(--navy);padding:60px 0}.upgrade-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px}.upgrade-inner h2{color:#fff;max-width:750px;margin-bottom:12px}.upgrade-inner p{max-width:730px;color:#dbe4ec;line-height:1.65;font-size:17px}.light{color:#d9e4ef}.light-button{background:#fff;color:var(--navy)!important;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:none}
    @media(max-width:900px){.hero-grid,.outcome-grid,.audience-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workbook-card{max-width:330px}.problem-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.included-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.offer-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.offer-price{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0 0}.upgrade-inner{display:block}.light-button{margin-top:15px}}
    @media(max-width:600px){.kit-container{width:min(100% - 28px,1120px)}.kit-hero{padding:50px 0 65px}.hero-copy h1{font-size:46px}.kit-lead{font-size:18px}.workbook-card{box-shadow:10px 12px 0 #dce4ec}.problem-grid,.included-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kit-section{padding:60px 0}.audience-card,.not-card,.offer-card{padding:28px 22px}.offer-copy h2{font-size:35px}.hero-proof{display:grid;gap:8px}.kit-button-large{width:100%}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
